=== root contract, end to end: engine in one repo, session in another ===

  PASS  1a POSITIVE  blocks a main-checkout write to the SESSION repo's protected tree
  PASS  1b NEGATIVE  does NOT block app/ — that tree is protected in the ENGINE's config, not the session's
  PASS  1c NEGATIVE  does not guard the ENGINE's own tree from the session's repo
  PASS  1d POSITIVE  stands down in an unadopted repository (never bricks an unrelated project)
  PASS  1e POSITIVE  a broken declared root BLOCKS with the loud banner
  PASS  2a POSITIVE  blocks a Bash write into the SESSION repo's protected tree
  PASS  2b NEGATIVE  does not block app/ (the ENGINE's protected tree, not the session's)
  PASS  3a POSITIVE  a truthful spawn against the SESSION roster is allowed
  PASS  3b POSITIVE  an untruthful model token is caught using the SESSION repo's roster
  PASS  3c POSITIVE  a NAMESPACED type is checked against the ENGINE roster (clark is sonnet, 'opus' rejected)
  PASS  3d NEGATIVE  the TRUTHFUL namespaced spawn is still allowed (3c is a real check, not a blanket block)
  PASS  3e POSITIVE  an unresolvable namespaced type is REFUSED, not waved through
  PASS  3f NEGATIVE  a bare built-in type with no definition is still allowed
  PASS  4a POSITIVE  drift state is written into the SESSION repo
  PASS  4b NEGATIVE  NOTHING was written into the engine's repo or the engine itself
  PASS  5a POSITIVE  snapshots the SESSION repo's roster, session-scoped
  PASS  5b POSITIVE  an unadopted repo is reported as a stand-down, not as 'skipped'
  PASS  5c NEGATIVE  the ambiguous 'snapshot: skipped' wording is gone
  PASS  5d POSITIVE  a broken root screams AND names the downstream consequence
  PASS  6a POSITIVE  finds the ENGINE's inventory and reads the SESSION's repo
  PASS  6b POSITIVE  a broken root is reported as a failure, not as a skip
  PASS  7a POSITIVE  announces ACTIVE and names the governed repository
  PASS  7b POSITIVE  announces the stand-down explicitly in an unadopted repo
  PASS  7c POSITIVE  announces a broken root as ENFORCEMENT IS NOT ACTIVE
  PASS  7d NEGATIVE  a stand-down is never announced as enforcement being on
  PASS  8a POSITIVE  the secret scanner still fires in the governed repo
  PASS  8b POSITIVE  and stands down in an unadopted repo

